# 2. DESIGN RULES
- Always enforce the Broadcast Sandwich Layout:
  * Eyebrow Kicker: +Y = +0.58m (scale 0.46)
  * Hero Center: Y = 0.00m (scale 0.68)
  * Sponsor Anchor: -Y = -0.58m (scale 0.38)
  * Pitch plane normal to camera vector: 61.74°
- Always enforce Symmetrical Centered Exits:
  * BURST_FORWARD, CENTER_IMPLODE, DROP_DOWN, LIFT_UP
  * Lock X = 0.0 and rot_z = 0.0°
- Palette: Laurier Gold #FDB913, Laurier Deep Purple #20003B (No pure white strokes).

